The '''Mapuzo safehouse''' was a [[Hidden Path]] safehouse located on [[Mapuzo]]. The safehouse was scrawled with messages from those who have come before, names and phrases of encouragement.<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|mapuzo-safehouse|Mapuzo safehouse}}</ref> It was one of several locations that [[Force-sensitive]]s could use to find refuge and passage on their way to a new life. After the [[Reva Sevander|Third Sister]] discovered the location, it is deemed compromised and abandoned.<ref name="DoR:TVG">''[[Star Wars: Dawn of Rebellion: The Visual Guide]]''</ref>

